"Somalia, Fed. Rep.",SOM,DT.DOD.DECT.CD,"Long-term public and publicly guaranteed debt data for 2024 are based on reports provided by the country. Long-term private nonguaranteed debt data and short-term debt data are not available. Beginning in 2018, the data reflect the outstanding debt stock, principal and interest arrears, and include late interest/penalties amounts following the reconcilation excercise by Goverment of Somalia with respective creditors. Data include the effects of Paris Club debt restructuring agreement, HIPC and MDRI debt relief. DSSI eligible and not participating in 2020 and 2021."
